 <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x101" flags="0x0">
  <title>DinoFuel V2 Part Throttle</title>
  <description>Unsigned big-endian Q2.14 multiplier. 1.0 is neutral. Fixed RPM and MAP axes; coefficient clamps outside the MAP scale. Use only with the matching V2 image and validate with check_calibration.py.</description>
